<title>HONG KONG: China Merchant Bank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Merchant Bank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Merchant Bank has mandated SBC Warburg to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of seven years with a put option in year five.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced at par to float at 70 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>General syndication is expected to start in mid-June.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
